344-62.value:
Outcome variable: per-section boundary-annulus enrichment of homeostatic-composition spots = (observed fraction of homeostatic-composition spots within 50 um of a DAM-cluster boundary) / (expected fraction under 1000 label permutations).
Predictor (observational): proximity to DAM clusters. Derived variables per spot: six-state composition vector from reference deconvolution (cell2location, reference = authors' 74,984-cell six-state microglia atlas);
DAM-high-composition and homeostatic-high-composition binary calls by per-section median split; DAM-cluster membership by DBSCAN (eps = 30 um) on spatial coordinates. Covariates recorded per section: condition (5xFAD/WT), age, sex, slide/capture area, anatomical region composition. Subsetting/exclusion variables: gray-matter annotation labels; per-section nFeature_Spatial QC threshold (5th percentile).

